  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "求两个不共线的向量的和, 有时候利用在平面几何中学过的平行四边形法则较为方便. 我们来复习这个法则.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 67,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0074#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "假如要求出不共线的向量$\\vec{a}$和$\\vec{b}$的和. 从任意点$O$作向量$\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\vec{a}$和$\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\vec{b}$(图80), 作平行四边形$AOBC$, 其中$[OC]$是平行四边形的对角线, 向量$\\overrightarrow{OC}$是所求的和. 实际上, 根据三角形法则有$\\overrightarrow{OA}+\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\overrightarrow{OA}+\\overrightarrow{AC}=\\overrightarrow{OC}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 67,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0074#6",
        "p0074#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-80",
      "label": "图 80",
      "printed_page": 67,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0074#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 80",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 80",
      "printed_page": 67,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0074#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**定义. 三个非零向量, 如果给出它们的方向的射线所在的直线平行于某个平面(图81), 这三个向量叫做共面向量.**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 67,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0074#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-81",
      "label": "图 81",
      "printed_page": 68,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0075#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 81",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 81",
      "printed_page": 68,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0075#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-82",
      "label": "图 82",
      "printed_page": 68,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0075#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 82",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 82",
      "printed_page": 68,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0075#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "当向量$\\overrightarrow{OA}$, $\\overrightarrow{OB}$, $\\overrightarrow{OC}$共面时, 点$O$, $A$, $B$, $C$属于同一个平面(图82).",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 68,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0075#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**定理11. 如果向量$\\vec{a}$和$\\vec{b}$不共线, 那么与向量$\\vec{a}$和$\\vec{b}$共面的任意一个向量$\\vec{c}$可以写成唯一的形式:**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 68,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0075#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$\\vec{c}=x\\vec{a}+y\\vec{b}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 68,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0075#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "证明. 设向量$\\vec{a}$, $\\vec{b}$, $\\vec{c}$共面, 并且$\\vec{a}$和$\\vec{b}$不共线, 求满足等式$\\vec{c}=x\\vec{a}+y\\vec{b}$. 由点$O$作向量$\\overrightarrow{OA}=\\vec{a}$, $\\overrightarrow{OB}=\\vec{b}$, $\\overrightarrow{OC}=\\vec{c}$, 从定理的条件得出点$O$, $A$, $B$, $C$属于某一个平面$\\alpha$. 我们研究$C\\notin(OA)$和$C\\notin(OB)$的情形(图83)在平面$\\alpha$内, 过点$C$作直线平行于直线$OA$和$OB$, 得到平行四边形$MONC$. 根据平行四边形法则，可以写成：$\\overrightarrow{OC}=\\overrightarrow{OM}+\\overrightarrow{ON}$. 但是，$\\overrightarrow{OM}=x\\overrightarrow{OA}$和$\\overrightarrow{ON}=y\\overrightarrow{OB}$（§20），所以$\\overrightarrow{OC}=x\\overrightarrow{OA}+y\\overrightarrow{OB}$，或者$\\vec{c}=x\\vec{a}+y\\vec{b}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 68,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0075#8",
        "p0076#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "text": "",
      "id": "fig-83",
      "label": "图 83",
      "printed_page": 68,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0075#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 83",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 83",
      "printed_page": 68,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0075#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "同样，如果$C\\in(OA)$或者$C\\in(OB)$，那么在最后的等式中分别有$y=0$或者$x=0$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 69,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0076#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "可以证明，数$x$和$y$是唯一确定的. 也就是说，如果$\\vec{c}=x\\vec{a}+y\\vec{b}$. 和$\\vec{c}=x_1\\vec{a}+y_1\\vec{b}$，那么$x=x_1$，$y=y_1$. $\\blacksquare$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 69,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0076#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果已知不共线的向量$\\vec{a}$和$\\vec{b}$，那么同$\\vec{a}$和$\\vec{b}$共面的向量$\\vec{c}$的表达式（写成$x\\vec{a}+y\\vec{b}$的形式），称为向量$\\vec{c}$关于向量$\\vec{a}$和$\\vec{b}$的**分解式**.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 69,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0076#4"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
